SUPK="Within the first second she bends her knees slightly and all nine tails rise behind her back and close together into one tall narrow bundle directly above her head, like a closed flower bud; the tails never spread sideways. Blue fox-fire lights up along the bundle and a narrow beam of blue fox-fire rises from the tip of the bundle straight up through the top edge of the frame for half a second. Then the beam fades, the tails slowly open back and she returns to the starting pose. "
