T['athena_bt_idle']=(True,"Idle. She is alive the whole time with slow continuous motion: she breathes deeply, shifts her weight from one leg to the other, her knees bend softly, she slowly turns her head in the helmet left and then right, rolls her shoulders, re-grips the spear shaft, lowers the shield a little and brings it back; her red cloak and the helmet crest sway. The spear stays upright the whole time, never tilts, swings or is raised. "+IDLE_END)
