T['athena_bt_atk']=(True,"Basic attack. The shield stays at her side. Within the first third of a second she pulls the spear back beside her hip and makes one quick straight thrust toward the viewer, the spear tip pointing at the viewer in front of the centre of her body, with a rich golden glow on the spear tip; she does not step or lean toward the camera and does not grow. The spear never points to the left, to the right or to the corners and never leaves the frame. Then the glow fades during a long relaxed recovery and she sets the spear upright again and returns to the starting pose. ")
AEG="Super skill Aegis. Within the first second she drops to one knee on the same spot and sets the round shield upright in front of her like a wall, the spear stays upright beside her; the shield lights up with rich golden light that pulses over its surface, and soft golden light rises from the top rim of the shield straight up and leaves through the top edge of the frame. Then the light fades, she stands up and returns to the starting pose. "
