A_ATK="Basic attack. The bow stays close to her body and never touches the edges of the frame. Within the first third of a second she lifts the bow in front of her with the bow pointing steeply upward, draws the string back to her cheek with an arrow of pale silver-blue moonlight on it, and releases: the string snaps forward and the moonlight arrow flies straight up along the bow's aim and leaves through the top edge of the frame. She aims up, never to the left or right and never at the viewer. Then the glow on the bow fades during a long relaxed recovery and she lowers the bow to the starting pose. "
A_SUP="Super skill Moon Volley. The bow stays close to her body and never touches the edges of the frame. Within the first second she plants her feet, leans back a little and lifts the bow in front of her pointing steeply upward; silver-blue moonlight runs along the bow limbs and the string, she draws the string to her cheek with three arrows of moonlight held close together, and releases: the string snaps forward and the three arrows fly straight up side by side and leave through the top edge of the frame. She aims up, never to the left or right and never at the viewer. Then the moonlight on the bow fades and she lowers the bow to the starting pose. "
A_HYP="Ultimate skill Hunt of the Giant. The bow stays close to her body and never touches the edges of the frame. Within the first second she drops to one knee on the same spot, raises the bow in front of her pointing steeply upward and draws the string to her cheek with one long thick arrow of bright silver-blue moonlight; moonlight gathers along the arrow and glows on her shoulders and hair, no threads or lines of light in the air; she releases and the heavy arrow flies straight up along the bow's aim and leaves through the top edge of the frame. She aims up, never to the left or right and never at the viewer. Then the moonlight fades, she stands up and lowers the bow to the starting pose. "
